// @title Sidechain pumping
// @category effect
// @details The kick turns the pad down every time it hits. Put duck on the kick with the number of
//   an orbit, and orbit with the same number on everything that should pump.
// @tags sidechain, duck, pump
// @by alienmind
// @credits Switch Angel
$: s("bd*4").bank("RolandTR909").duck(2).duckattack(.2).duckdepth(.8)
$: chord("<Am7 Dm7>").voicing().s("supersaw").orbit(2).gain(.4)
